1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,638
BAMBANG: Dik Dimas!

2
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,988
SEKAR: Mas Dimas!

3
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,218
DIMAS: Aku cuma wali kota!

4
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:03,900
DIMAS (batin): Kok bisa begini?

5
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:08,491
DIMAS (batin): Tiga tahun lalu, kota ini tenggelam tiap Februari.

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,050
DIMAS (batin): Banjir.

7
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,300
DIMAS (batin): Sampah.

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,550
DIMAS (batin): Pungli.

9
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,980
DIMAS (batin): Kata orang, nggak bisa dibenerin.

10
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,630
DIMAS (batin): Aku dulu cuma ojol yang hobi lapor jalan bolong.

11
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,374
DIMAS (batin): Laporanku nggak pernah dibalas.

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,400
DIMAS (batin): Jadi aku nyalon sendiri. Modal patungan warga.

13
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,979
WARGA: Pak Wali!

14
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:28,430
DIMAS (batin): Sekarang umurku 28, dan aku wali kotanya.

15
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,762
DIMAS (batin): Di Nusa Wacana, itu sah.

16
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,906
IBU: Makan dulu, Le. Wali kota juga butuh gorengan.

17
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,650
DIMAS: Iya, Bu.

18
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,438
IBU: Siapa, Le?

19
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:47,544
DIMAS: ...Calon presiden, Bu.

20
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,030
BAMBANG: Dik Dimas! Anak muda kayak kamu itu laku.

21
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:55,185
BAMBANG: Jadi wakil saya, ya? Besok pagi saya tunggu jawabannya.

22
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,674
IBU: Gorengan, Pak?

23
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:01,726
SEKAR: Mas Dimas. Jangan jawab Bambang dulu.

24
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:02,756
BAMBANG: Lho, Sekar?!

25
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:04,355
SEKAR: Tawaran saya jauh lebih baik.

26
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,730
IBU: Le... tempenya gosong.

27
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,665
DIMAS (batin): Malam ini aku harus jawab apa?

